  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your sublime personal harmony makes every performance resplendent.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Perfected Performance<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as you have at least 1 point in your ki pool, any bardic performance (or similar performance ability) you use takes effected as if you were 2 levels higher, and if the d20 result on any Perform check is less than your mythic tier, you treat the result as equal to your mythic tier. You can expend 1 point from your ki pool to add a mythic surge to a Perform check. If you expend a use of mythic power to activate a mythic surge as part of a perform check, you roll the surge die twice and select the better result.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc59\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
